              "c": true
            },
            {
              "b": [
                "\n",
                "^The courtyard on the right takes you to Mury. Good luck! ",
                "#",
                "^speaker:npc_ostap",
                "/#",
                "\n",
                "end",
                {
                  "->": "0.5"
                },
                null
              ]
            }
          ],
          "nop",
          "\n",
          "ev",
          {
            "VAR?": "pirogov_asked"
          },
          "/ev",
          [
            {
              "->": ".^.b",
              "c": true
            },
            {
              "b": [
                "\n",
                "^Pirogov was a «хірург», a surgeon, remember? Go around via Soborna. ",
                "#",
                "^speaker:npc_ostap",
                "/#",
                "\n",
                "end",
                {
                  "->": "0.11"
                },
                null
              ]
            }
          ],
          "nop",
          "\n",
          "^Hi! I'm Ostap. I study to be a doctor, «лікар», at the Pirogov Medical University. Heard of him? ",
          "#",
          "^speaker:npc_ostap",
          "/#",
          "\n",
          "ev",
          "str",
          "^Ні, хто це? (No, who is that?)",
          "/str",
          "/ev",
          {
            "*": "0.c-0",
            "flg": 20
          },
          "ev",
          "str",
          "^Трохи. Розкажи! (A bit. Tell me!)",
          "/str",
          "/ev",
          {
            "*": "0.c-1",
            "flg": 20
          },
          {
            "c-0": [
              "\n",
              {
                "->": "0.g-0"
              },
              {
                "#f": 5
              }
            ],
            "c-1": [
              "\n",
              {
                "->": "0.g-0"
              },
              {
                "#f": 5
              }
            ],
            "g-0": [
              "^Mykola Pirogov was a great surgeon, «хірург». He was one of the first to operate with ether anaesthesia right in the field, during war.",
              "\n",
              "^He spent his last years near Vinnytsia, at the Vyshnia estate. It's a museum now.",
              "\n",
              "^So, a quick check: who was Pirogov? ",
              "#",
              "^quiz:pirogov_1",
              "/#",
              "\n",
              "ev",
              true,
              "/ev",
              {
                "VAR=": "pirogov_asked",
                "re": true
              },
              "ev",
              {
                "VAR?": "quiz_ok"
              },
              "/ev",
              [
                {
                  "->": ".^.b",
                  "c": true
                },
                {
                  "b": [
                    "\n",
                    "^Exactly! You listen well.",
                    "\n",
                    "ev",
                    true,
                    "/ev",
                    {
                      "VAR=": "knows_pirogov",
                      "re": true
                    },
                    "ev",
                    {
                      "VAR?": "trust"
                    },
                    1,
                    "+",
                    {
                      "VAR=": "trust",
                      "re": true
                    },
                    "/ev",
                    "^Take this courtyard, it's a shortcut to Mury. ",
                    "#",
                    "^flag:shortcut_open",
                    "/#",
                    "\n",
                    {
                      "->": "0.g-0.18"
                    },
                    null
                  ]
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "->": ".^.b"
                },
                {
                  "b": [
                    "\n",
                    "^Not quite. He was a «хірург», a doctor who does operations.",
                    "\n",
                    "^Here's a postcard with the short version. ",
                    "#",
                    "^give:pirogov_card",
                    "/#",
                    "\n",
                    "^Go around via Soborna, you won't get lost.",
                    "\n",
                    {
                      "->": "0.g-0.18"
                    },
                    null
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "nop",
              "\n",
              "end",
              [
                "done",
                {
                  "#n": "g-1"
                }
              ],
              null
            ]
          }
        ],
